    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>After the Creator has created therianthropes, several 100 years passed away.<br>Wolfy boy Fito was trapped in the world of board game, and found a creepy cat Kou which has a magic power.<br><br>Meet colorful characters with Fito &amp; Kou and work together from getting out of this creepy world.<br><br>And YOU are the one who can help them.<br>Don\u2019t worry.<br>We can rewind the time any time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">System</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984200/extras/bb4f2d69b36dc1fbb2e1f8b36acb8a08.poster.avif?t=1737732110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984200/extras/bb4f2d69b36dc1fbb2e1f8b36acb8a08.webm?t=1737732110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984200/extras/bb4f2d69b36dc1fbb2e1f8b36acb8a08.mp4?t=1737732110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This game is a tactical role-playing game that doesn\u2019t have level-up system.<br>The battle situations will significantly change by the skills and items which you robbed or picked up at the previous stage.<br><br>Like a \u201cShield\u201d, there are items that supports your party by just having in their pockets.<br>And the other hand, there are items like a \u201cMedicine\u201d that doesn\u2019t heal you until you use it.<br>Not all but, you can place some items on the ground and get their supports as well.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984200/extras/727bdcd0a241594030a7b8e99f5fe30d.poster.avif?t=1737732110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984200/extras/727bdcd0a241594030a7b8e99f5fe30d.webm?t=1737732110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984200/extras/727bdcd0a241594030a7b8e99f5fe30d.mp4?t=1737732110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The blacky cat Kou also will be your item and supports your party.<br>She has a  unique skills, but if the character who holds her is defeated, it is the game over.<br><br>All of the characters (including the boss enemies) has their own treasures.<br>You can steal them from enemies but Fito is the only one who has the stealing skill.<br>He is too weak to get reach to the boss enemies alone so support him with the other members.<br>Their story will change by having or not having these specific treasure items.<br><br>Other Features:<br>*Multiple endings<br>*For quitting the battle scene, the Quick Save is available.<br>*Skipping and changing the battle animation speed are always there for busy person.<br>*Unlimited Turn Rewind System.",
